    "id": "v4_plan_revise_twice",
    "requirement": "continuity",
    "message": "I'd like a small web page that turns miles into kilometres, and I want it to look nice. Give me a plan first. Do not build anything yet.",
    "setup": [],
    "tags": [
      "verdict4",
      "continuity"
    ],
    "suites": [
      "verdict4"
    ],
    "heldout": true,
    "size": "small",
    "timeout_seconds": 600,
    "claims": true,
    "rubric": [
      "The first reply is a plan of steps, with assumptions stated, and nothing is built",
      "The revision changes the same plan (a new version of it) and does not start a second plan or a search for a file",
      "The second revision says where the pictures and animation files come from and how they load on this machine",
      "At no point is a question about hand-over to a coding agent offered, and no question is asked of the person"
